| Platform      | darwin                           |
| Architecture  | arm64                            |
| Apple Silicon | true                             |
| CPU           | Apple M2 Pro                     |
| CPU 1         | Apple M2 Pro                     |
| CPU 2         | Apple M2 Pro                     |
| GPU           | 16 cores, Metal Support: Metal 4 |
| Memory        | 16 GB                            |
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Build Environment

┌─────────────┬─────────────────┐
| Wails CLI   | Your installed version |
| Go Version  | go1.25.0        |
└─────────────┴─────────────────┘

